<title>UK: Texaco sets $200 mln seven-year convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Texaco sets $200 mln seven-year convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following convertible bond was announced by lead manager CSFB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TEXACO CAPITAL INC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  TEXACO INC</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON   **3.50	MATURITY	*  2004</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    =</p>
<p> NOTES   *  CALL END YEAR TWO AT PAR PLUS ACCRUED</p>
<p>	   ** INDICATIVE CONVERSION PREMIUM 20-24 PCT</p>
<p> LIST	 LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
